        <mxCell id="yFI-hpcA_uPZDY2qY_ZT-233" value="&amp;nbsp;New: Keep track of first merged keep-in zone the vehicle starts in, or none. If it was in one originally, then check if stated position is ever not in merged zone.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Old: Keep track of first merged keep-in zone the vehicle starts in, or none. If was in one originall then check if it ever leaves it&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Oldest: When a keep-in zone is left, check if the vehicle used to be in it.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=internalStorage;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;dx=20;dy=0;align=right;" vertex="1" parent="1">
